  "document": "The Mark of the Renegade\nThe Mark of the Renegade is a 1951 American Technicolor adventure western film directed by Hugo Fregonese starring Ricardo Montalban and Cyd Charisse. The film is based on the novel\" Don Renegade\" by Johnston McCulley, and is set in Mexican- ruled Los Angeles in the 1820s."
